4,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We should avoid adding another program without reviewing the efficacy of previous ones. We need evidence of patient outcomes before deciding.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. However, we must also consider if the hospital can physically and systemically absorb a new program without seizing up.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A prudent start. I suspect our failures aren't due to a lack of ambition, but a lack of structural durability in our partnerships.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so excited to get started! But we have to make sure the people working the shifts aren't too tired, right? Let's check the staffing!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, my friends. Let us ensure that what we build today does not become a financial burden for the children of tomorrow.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Toshio, if we are checking capacity, we should specifically look at the data from previous trials to see where they failed.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,Precisely. I want to know exactly how the booking systems and physical spaces are currently utilized.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If we wish to avoid the ""second-year collapse,"" we should examine the agreements we've made with outside bodies. Vague promises are not foundations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that sounds a bit scary! I just want to make sure everyone is happy and not overworked. Can we look at the vacancies?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,A house is only as strong as its foundation. We must look at the ledger and the tariffs to see if this is truly sustainable.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will focus on the readmission figures and the shared nursing rounds to see what actually worked in the past.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will investigate the booking system records and the rooms, parking, and shuttle coverage.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall look into the data agreements with outside surgeries and the board minutes on the jointly run clinic.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I'll check the ward nursing vacancies and the therapy and midwifery staffing review! I want to see who needs the most help!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I shall examine this year's development allocation in the ledger and the regional fund tariffs by contact location.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
